### GET one post (public demo API)
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Accept: application/json

### GET posts by user
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts?userId=1
Accept: application/json

### POST a demo post (mock service; not persisted)
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "UNICORN Ω API example",
  "body": "This is a learning payload.",
  "userId": 1
}

### PATCH a demo post (mock service; not persisted)
PATCH https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title"
}

### DELETE a demo post (mock service; not persisted)
DELETE https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Accept: application/json
